    "description": "A unique immersive theatre space in Wembley.\r\n\r\nPunchdrunk Enrichment creates immersive theatre experiences for families, schools and communities. Through our adventurous, high-quality approach to storytelling we champion the imagination.\r\nAt our creative home in Brent we run family theatre shows, community days, masterclasses and more. Come and explore!",
