    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "About Punchdrunk Enrichment Stores",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Inspired by bric-a-brac shops of old, what lies behind our faded red shop front is not what you expect.\nDesigned by Kate Rigby and Casey Jay Andrews with our former Artistic Director Peter Higgin, Punchdrunk Enrichment Stores is our home for immersive theatre productions for young audiences, along with schools workshops and masterclasses.\nThis space is only open to the public for an extremely limited number of times this year. For Open House, you can book onto a short tour to  learn more about the objects that fill the shelves, and how it was developed with young people in Brent. We’ll have a surprise along the way too.",
                "Suitable for immersive theatre fans, designers and anyone who likes a bit of magic."
            ]
        }
    ],
